      "text": "We don't need `old.txt` anymore, and `main.html` should be `index.html`."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Use `git rm old.txt` to delete it and stage the deletion."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Use `git mv main.html index.html` to rename the file and stage the rename."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ada",
      "text": "Then commit the changes."
    }
  ],
